account.description:
Reading the balance requires a signed-in session. This integration uses the official Towngas WeChat authorization and never stores your password.

1. Scan the QR code below with **WeChat on your phone**;
2. After authorizing, the page redirects to `{oauth_redirect}`;
3. Copy the value after `authCode=` from the redirect URL into the authCode field below.

{oauth_qr_markdown}

> If the QR code does not render, copy the URL from the "Authorization URL" field below and open it with WeChat on your phone.

**subsCode**: the last part of the billing URL, for example 1700075442 in .../ZS0105/**1700075442**.

**subsId**: a 32 character account id. Log in at https://www.towngasvcc.com/?login=true (phone number + SMS code) and open https://www.towngasvcc.com/user/querySubsList — the `subsId` field in the returned JSON.

{error_detail}

reauth_confirm.description:
The session for subscriber {subs_code} has expired, please authorize again:

1. Scan the QR code below with **WeChat on your phone**;
2. Copy the value after `authCode=` from the redirect URL into the authCode field below.

{oauth_qr_markdown}

> If the QR code does not render, copy the URL from the "Authorization URL" field below and open it with WeChat on your phone.

{error_detail}
